  "method": "Both probes replayed only nine consumed canonical screen geometries through the frozen candidate Agent source and official local generator, with a camera-only in-memory _adjust_obstacle_steering override on that single controller. Preflight checked protocol, committed control source, both snapshots, model, helpers, harness, environment, complete screen summary, and each candidate receipt before and after replay. No live selector, frozen source, confirmation, or blind partition changed.",
